<section class="container detail-layout" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Product">
 <div class="detail-visual"><img itemprop="image" src="<%= product.image %>" alt="Catalogue illustration of <%= product.name %>, pattern <%= product.pattern %>" width="440" height="600"><p>Illustration from the supplied surgical catalogue.</p></div>
 <div class="detail-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><%= product.type %></p><h1 itemprop="name"><%= product.name %></h1><p class="reference">Reference <code itemprop="sku"><%= product.code %></code></p><p itemprop="description">A <%= product.length %> instrument listed in the Surgical Essence surgical catalogue. Use the reference below to discuss quantities and sourcing requirements.</p><table class="spec-table"><caption>Catalogue specifications</caption><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Instrument type</th><td><%= product.type %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pattern</th><td><%= product.pattern %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Length</th><td><%= product.length %></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Reference number</th><td><code><%= product.code %></code></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Material / finish</th><td>Confirm with our team</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Availability & order quantity</th><td>Confirmed with quotation</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="actions"><button class="button" data-add="<%= product.code %>" data-name="<%= product.name %>">Add to quote list <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><a class="button outline" href="/quote-list">Review quote list</a></div><noscript><p>To request this instrument without JavaScript, enter <%= product.code %> on the <a href="/request-quote">quotation form</a>.</p></noscript><a class="document-link" href="/documents/surgical.pdf#page=<%= product.page %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View source catalogue · PDF page <%= product.page %> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> opens in a new tab</span></a></div>
</section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="container detail-notes"><div><h2>Confirm the details before you order.</h2><p>Ask about available variants, material, finish, reprocessing information and applicable documentation for your destination market. A catalogue entry is not a statement of regulatory approval or current stock.</p><a class="text-link" href="/quality">Quality & documentation ↗</a></div><div><h2>Need a different pattern?</h2><p>Share another catalogue reference or describe the instrument you need. For private-label projects, include marking and packaging requirements.</p><a class="text-link" href="/request-quote">Send your requirements ↗</a></div></div></section>
<%- include('partials/cta') %>
